# The 16-bar theme (A A B A) with verse 1 of the hymn. Bar 12 ends with the famous
# early entry: "Giv-" starts on beat 4 and is tied into bar 13.

chords:
| D | A7 | D | D A7 | D | A7 | D | A7 D |
| A7 D | A7 D | A7 | D | D | A7 | D | A7 D |

melody:
Joy-ful, joy-ful, we a-dore Thee,
F#4 F#4 G4 A4 A4 G4 F#4 E4
God of glo-ry, Lord of love;
D4 D4 E4 F#4 F#4. E4/ E4(2)
Hearts un-fold like flow'rs be-fore Thee,
F#4 F#4 G4 A4 A4 G4 F#4 E4
O-p'ning to the sun a-bove.
D4 D4 E4 F#4 E4. D4/ D4(2)
Melt the clouds of sin and sad-ness;
E4 E4 F#4 D4 E4 F#4/ ~G4/ F#4 D4
Drive the dark of doubt a-way;
E4 F#4/ ~G4/ F#4 E4 D4 E4 A3
Giv-er of im-mor-tal glad-ness,
F#4 ~F#4 F#4 G4 A4 A4 G4 F#4 E4
Fill us with the light of day!
D4 D4 E4 F#4 E4. D4/ D4(2)
